source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A later run of three is not a lone escape, so Jira keeps every backslash and the pair does not break; jiro keeps all five.
-- input.jira --
a\\b\\\c
-- rendered.html --
<p>a\\b\\\c</p>
-- want.md --
a\\\\b\\\\\\c
-- warnings.json --
[]
